1
00:00:00,071 --> 00:00:00,592
Pause.

2
00:00:01,253 --> 00:00:05,399
Place one hand near your heart or wherever feels comforting.

3
00:00:12,609 --> 00:00:14,292
Take a gentle breath.

4
00:00:15,585 --> 00:00:18,287
Now notice what is hard right now.

5
00:00:19,387 --> 00:00:21,149
You do not have to explain it.

6
00:00:21,909 --> 00:00:24,170
You do not have to fix it.

7
00:00:24,951 --> 00:00:26,592
Just name it quietly.

8
00:00:27,733 --> 00:00:28,733
This is hard.

9
00:00:29,714 --> 00:00:37,239
Now remind yourself, a part of me is struggling, and that part deserves compassion.

10
00:00:38,159 --> 00:00:40,401
Silently say, I see you.

11
00:00:40,421 --> 00:00:41,021
I am here with you.

12
00:00:44,364 --> 00:00:47,487
We can take this one step at a time.

13
00:00:54,936 --> 00:00:57,159
Take one more breath.

14
00:00:58,140 --> 00:01:01,304
Let the words land as much as they can.

15
00:01:02,305 --> 00:01:05,048
You do not need to feel perfect compassion.

16
00:01:05,068 --> 00:01:07,972
A small pause is enough.
